Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.81,0:06:53.26,pos,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0))\alpha&90&\pos(75,100)\frz-90\1c&HFFA2FF&}记忆
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.76,0:07:04.10,pos,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0))\alpha&90&\pos(350,130)\frz-90\1c&HFFA2FF&}一次？
